:114684,"page_no":897,"line_no":114684,"gurmukhi":"ਰੂੰਈ ਤੇ ਕਛੁ ਚੋਟ ਨ ਲਾਗੀ ॥","translit_en":"roo(n)iee te kachh choT na laagee ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਰੂੰ (ਨਾਲ ਲਿਪਟੇ ਹੋਣ ਕਾਰਨ) ਕੋਈ ਸਟ ਨਾ ਲਗੀ।"}}},{"verse_id":114685,"page_no":897,"line_no":114685,"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਾਨ ਬਚਾਇ ਗਯੋ ਬਡਭਾਗੀ ॥੧੬॥","translit_en":"praan bachai gayo baddabhaagee ||16||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"In view of cotton around him he was not hurt and he was able to save his life.(16)"},"pu":{"ss":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਉਹ) ਵਡਭਾਗੀ ਪ੍ਰਾਣ ਬਚਾ ਕੇ ਚਲਾ ਗਿਆ ॥੧੬॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":10344,"next":10346}}